uby>を<ruby>食<rt>た</rt></ruby>べると<ruby>力尽<rt>ちからつ</rt></ruby>きて、</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\">ソファーで<ruby>寝<rt>ね</rt></ruby>てしまうクセが<ruby>再発<rt>さいはつ</rt></ruby>しています。</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\">ご<ruby>飯<rt>はん</rt></ruby>の<ruby>前<rt>まえ</rt></ruby>にお<ruby>風呂<rt>ふろ</rt></ruby>！！が<ruby>必勝<rt>ひっしょう</rt></ruby><ruby>法<rt>ほう</rt></ruby>。</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\">みなさんも<ruby>頑張<rt>がんば</rt></ruby>りすぎないでね。</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\">━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\"></p><div><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2023-12-26/54064_1.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></div><br><p></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\"><br></p></div><div><ruby>今年<rt>ことし</rt></ruby>のクリスマスは<ruby>黒<rt>くろ</rt></ruby><ruby>猫<rt>ねこ</rt></ruby>サンタをチョイスしました。</div><div>たまには<ruby>王道<rt>おうどう</rt></ruby><ruby>以外<rt>いがい</rt></ruby>もありかなと。🐾</div><div>　</div><div>　</div><div>【1~2<ruby>部<rt>ぶ</rt></ruby>】<ruby>巻<rt>ま</rt></ruby>き<ruby>髪<rt>かみ</rt></ruby></div><div><div><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2023-12-26/54064_2.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></div><br></div><div>　</div><div>【3<ruby>部<rt>ぶ</rt></ruby>】ハーフアップ</div><div><div><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2023-12-26/54064_3.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></div><br></div><div>　</div><div>【4<ruby>部<rt>ぶ</rt></ruby>】まとめヘア</div><div><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2023-12-26/54064_4.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></div><br><div>　</div><div>【5~6<ruby>部<rt>ぶ</rt></ruby>】おろしヘア</div><div><div><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2023-12-26/54064_5.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></div><br><div dir=\"ltr\"></div></div><div>　</div><div>　</div><div>　</div><div>どの<ruby>金村<rt>かなむら</rt></ruby><ruby>派<rt>は</rt></ruby>ですか？？？</div><div>　</div><div>　</div><div>　</div><div><div><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2023-12-26/54064_6.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></div><br></div><div>　</div><div>　</div><div>みんなもクリスマス<ruby>仕様<rt>しよう</rt></ruby>で<ruby>可愛<rt>かわい</rt></ruby>かった〜！</div><div>🎄🛷🦌🎅🏻</div><div>　</div><div>　</div><div>━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</div><div>　</div><div>そして、このミーグリ<ruby>後<rt>ご</rt></ruby>に<ruby>発表<rt>はっぴょう</rt></ruby>された</div><div><ruby>嬉<rt>うれ</rt></ruby>しいお<ruby>知<rt>し</rt></ruby>らせをひとつ。</div><div>　</div><div><span style=\"font-size:19px\">《</span><b style=\"font-size:19px\"><ruby>宮崎<rt>みやざき</rt></ruby><ruby>県<rt>けん</rt></ruby>でひなあいの<ruby>放送<rt>ほうそう</rt></ruby>が<ruby>決<rt>き</rt></ruby>まりました🎊</b><span style=\"font-size:19px\">》</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:19px\"><br></span></div><div><ruby>地方<rt>ちほう</rt></ruby>のおひさまを<ruby>増<rt>ふ</rt></ruby>やすことが<ruby>大<rt>おお</rt></ruby>きな<ruby>課題<rt>かだい</rt></ruby>だと<ruby>感<rt>かん</rt></ruby>じていたので、ひとつ<ruby>前進<rt>ぜんしん</rt></ruby>できて<ruby>本当<rt>ほんとう</rt></ruby>に<ruby>嬉<rt>うれ</rt></ruby>しいです！！</div><div>　</div><div>MRT<ruby>宮崎放送<rt>みやざきほうそう</rt></ruby>さまありがとうございます！</div><div>　</div><div><ruby>今回<rt>こんかい</rt></ruby>ご<ruby>縁<rt>えん</rt></ruby>をきっかけにもっと<ruby>色々<rt>いろいろ</rt></ruby>な<ruby>地域<rt>ちいき</rt></ruby>で<ruby>放送<rt>ほうそう</rt></ruby>したいと<ruby>思<rt>おも</rt></ruby>って<ruby>頂<rt>いただ</rt></ruby>けるよう、<ruby>精進<rt>しょうじん</rt></ruby>して<ruby>参<rt>まい</rt></ruby>ります🥭</div><div>　</div><div>【<a href=\"https://youtu.be/oChFcZN_GCk?feature=shared\">https://youtu.be/oChFcZN_GCk?feature=shared</a>】</div><div>　</div><div><ruby>詳<rt>くわ</rt></ruby>しくは<ruby>日向<rt>ひなた</rt></ruby><ruby>坂<rt>ざか</rt></ruby>ちゃんねるをご<ruby>覧<rt>らん</rt></ruby><ruby>下<rt>くだ</rt></ruby>さい！</div><div>　</div><div>━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</div><div>　</div><div>　</div><div><div><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2023-12-26/54064_7.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></div><br></div><div>　</div><div>　</div><div>ほしいものは、うーん、</div><div><ruby>何<rt>なに</rt></ruby>でもどんとこい！みたいな<ruby>強<rt>つよ</rt></ruby>いメンタル！</div><div>　</div><div>おねがいします！！</div><div>　</div><div>　</div><div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\"><span class=\"s1\">■<ruby>金村<rt>かなむら</rt></ruby><ruby>美玖<rt>みく</rt></ruby><ruby>公式<rt>こうしき</rt></ruby>Instagram📸</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/miku_osushi/\">https://www.instagram.com/miku_osushi/&nbsp;</a>&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal;min-height:22px\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"text-decoration:underli